{"t":"Larva Caves","s":"larva-caves-42bab","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Larva_cda9ab.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Larva Caves</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Larva\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Larva_cda9ab.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Near city</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"location\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Location</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Under the desert north of <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a>. here, here, here and here.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"vocation\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Vocation(s)</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">All vocations.</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Level &amp; Skills' Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvlknights\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"> <div class=\"skills-box\"> <h3 class=\"skills-box-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-General\">General</span></h3> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Knights</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">15</span> and 50 / 50 (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Paladins</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">15</span> and 45 /  (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Mages</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">13</span> </div> </div><div class=\"skills-box\"> <h3 class=\"skills-box-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-For_Deeper_Levels\">For Deeper Levels</span></h3> <div class=\"skills-box-label\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knights</a></div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">30</span> and 65 / 60 (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladins</a></div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">30</span> and 65 /  (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Mages</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">30</span> </div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Monk\">Monks</a></div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">?</span> and ? / ? (Fist/ML)</div></div><div class=\"skills-box\"> <h3 class=\"skills-box-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-For_Ancient_Scarabs\">For Ancient Scarabs</span></h3> <div class=\"skills-box-label\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knights</a></div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">80</span> and 85 / 85 (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladins</a></div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">75</span> and 80 /  (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Mages</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">60</span> </div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Monk\">Monks</a></div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">?</span> and ? / ? (Fist/ML)</div></div> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Profit Hourly</caption>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"exp\">Experience</th>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"loot\">Loot</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"exp\"><p style=\"text-align: center; color: green\"><b>Good</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0.4em 0 0.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"loot\"><p style=\"text-align: center; color: green\"><b>Good</b></p><p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0.4em 0 0.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Notable Loot</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Terra Hood\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Terra_Hood_7ac145.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot2\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Scarab Shield\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Scarab_Shield_abc57f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Daramian Waraxe\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Daramian_Waraxe_03faf4.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Scarab Pincers\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Scarab_Pincers_f1df29.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Emerald\"><img alt=\"Small Emerald\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Small_Emerald_279b08.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">7.3<br/>August 11, 2004</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>Under the sands of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Kha%27labal\">Kha'labal</a> are vast caves created and inhabited by <a href=\"#/wiki/Larva\">Larvae</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Scarab\">Scarabs</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Scarab\">Ancient Scarabs</a>. To open these caves, you must use a <a href=\"#/wiki/Shovel\">Shovel</a> on the sand. Note that it may not open with the first try, so you must keep trying until the hole appears.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<ul><li>In these caves you can find <a href=\"#/wiki/Larva\">Larvae</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Scarab\">Scarabs</a> and even <a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Scarab\">Ancient Scarabs</a>.</li>\n<li>Most caves are consist of:\n<ul><li>1st floor: only <a href=\"#/wiki/Larva\">Larvae</a>.</li>\n<li>2nd floor: <a href=\"#/wiki/Larva\">Larvae</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Scarab\">Scarabs</a>.</li>\n<li>3rd floor: <a href=\"#/wiki/Larva\">Larvae</a> and lots of <a href=\"#/wiki/Scarab\">Scarabs</a>.</li>\n<li>4th floor (not in all larva caves): <a href=\"#/wiki/Larva\">Larvae</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Scarab\">Scarabs</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Scarab\">Ancient Scarabs</a>.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Larva\"><img alt=\"Larva\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Larva_cda9ab.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Larva\">Larva</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">44</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">70</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">36 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">35 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">1 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Earth Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_7605e0.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span>)</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-15× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Meat\">Meat</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Scarab\"><img alt=\"Scarab\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Scarab_19394f.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Scarab\">Scarab</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">120</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">320</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">115</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-52× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>0-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Meat\">Meat</a> (common)</li>\n<li>Piece of Scarab Shell (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Scarab%20Coin\">Scarab Coin</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Amethyst\">Small Amethyst</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Daramian Mace (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Emerald\">Small Emerald</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Scarab\"><img alt=\"Ancient Scarab\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ancient_Scarab_089460.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Scarab\">Ancient Scarab</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">720</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1,000</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">381 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">210 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">171 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Earth Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_7605e0.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span>) + <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">105 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Summons\"><img alt=\"Summons\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"11\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Player_Summon_dc8280.gif\" width=\"11\"/></span></span></span></span>.</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-187× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Magic%20Light%20Wand\">Magic Light Wand</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Scarab%20Coin\">Scarab Coin</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Emerald\">Small Emerald</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-4× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Amethyst\">Small Amethyst</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Scarab Pincers (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Plate%20Armor\">Plate Armor</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Scarab Amulet (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Ancient Amulet (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Health%20Potion\">Strong Health Potion</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Scarab Shield (rare)</li>\n<li>Springsprout Rod (rare)</li>\n<li>Daramian Waraxe (very rare)</li>\n<li>Terra Hood (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Locations\">Locations</span></h2>\n<p>There are 5 <a href=\"#/wiki/Larva\">Larva</a> Caves:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Near the west exit of <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a>. It's located <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33072,32760,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33072, 32760, 7)</a>. If you are looking for <a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Scarab\">Ancient Scarabs</a>, go down <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33096,32749,9\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33096, 32749, 9)</a> and then <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33053,32776,10\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33053, 32776, 10)</a>. It is the biggest and most difficult spot, dangerous for lower level paladins and mages - it resembles a chain consisting of several caves. Also, the lair of <a href=\"#/wiki/Fleshcrawler\">Fleshcrawler</a> is located here, at the very <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33045,32794,11\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">end (33045, 32794, 11)</a> of the cave.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Larva Cave 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"280\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Larva_Cave_1_a82d72.png\" width=\"237\"/></span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Scarab Cave 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"254\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Scarab_Cave_1_ed5f80.png\" width=\"260\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>West of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Tomb\">Stone Tomb</a>. It's located <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33257,32743,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33257, 32743, 7)</a>. If you are looking for <a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Scarab\">Ancient Scarabs</a>, go down <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33217,32772,9\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33217, 32772, 9)</a> and then <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33251,32812,10\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33251, 32812, 10)</a>. This is probably the easiest spot to hunt them.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Larva Cave 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"267\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Larva_Cave_2_263d3d.png\" width=\"258\"/></span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Scarab Cave 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"250\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Scarab_Cave_2_79a693.png\" width=\"260\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>North of the north exit of <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a>. It's located <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33153,32686,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33153, 32686, 7)</a>. If you are looking for <a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Scarab\">Ancient Scarabs</a>, go down <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33117,32676,9\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33117, 32676, 9)</a> and then <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33063,32651,10\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33063, 32651, 10)</a>. This spot is particularly dense, it may happen that you lure <a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Scarab\">Ancient Scarabs</a> you don't want to. What's more, there is only one field space between stairs and the wall, so you can be easily blocked by a summoned <a href=\"#/wiki/Larva\">Larva</a> while running around the staircase and shooting.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Larva Cave 3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"240\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Larva_Cave_3_60fc80.png\" width=\"235\"/></span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Scarab Cave 3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"208\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Scarab_Cave_3_ee59cf.png\" width=\"260\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Between the tar pits and ancient ruins. It's located <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33219,32640,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33219, 32640, 7)</a>.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Larva Cave 4\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"255\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Larva_Cave_4_fe93a7.png\" width=\"256\"/></span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Scarab Cave 4\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"279\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Scarab_Cave_4_82e8c3.png\" width=\"240\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>North-east of the oasis. This is a hidden cave like the <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun%20Tombs\">Ankrahmun Tombs</a>. It is located <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33161,32598,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33161, 32598, 7)</a>.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Larva Cave 5\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"201\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Larva_Cave_5_80c3d3.png\" width=\"200\"/></span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Scarab Cave 5\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"206\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Scarab_Cave_5_dbbccf.png\" width=\"250\"/></span><br/>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategies\">Strategies</span></h2>\n<p>For <a href=\"#/wiki/Larva\">Larvae</a>:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Just don't let them surround you, a group of <a href=\"#/wiki/Larva\">Larvae</a> can be dangerous attacking at the same time.</li></ul>\n<p>For <a href=\"#/wiki/Scarab\">Scarabs</a>:\n</p>\n<ul><li><b>Knights</b>: They don't have much defense, just don't let them surround you, they can deal huge damage when in group, an exori will help you in such a situation. If you use a weapon enchanted with fire it will also help a great deal.</li>\n<li><b>Mages</b>: A good tactic is to use Wands or Rods &amp; exori flam, since scarabs take good damage from them. Watch out because they'll run when in low health, don't chase them for too long or you may get surrounded by larvae and scarabs. If you get surrounded a GFB can take care of the situation. It's a good idea to take a Terra Hood or Terra Boots to lower the poison damage you'll receive.</li></ul>\n<p>For <a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Scarab\">Ancient Scarabs</a>:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Remember that spawn of <a href=\"#/wiki/Larva\">Larvae</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Scarab\">Scarabs</a>, and <a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Scarab\">Ancient Scarabs</a> can no longer be blocked.</li>\n<li>If you are paladin or mage, staircase will be your best defensive weapon against <a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Scarab\">Ancient Scarabs</a> - just run around it. In case of emergency don't hesitate to use <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Bomb%20Rune\">Fire Bomb Runes</a> to block <a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Scarab\">Ancient Scarab</a> or to create more space to run safety next to the staircase.</li>\n<li>Don't kill <a href=\"#/wiki/Scarab\">Scarabs</a> - it is better to let them run at deep red hp.</li>\n<li>Try to estimate the respawn time of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Scarab\">Ancient Scarab</a> near the staircase (it is approximately 5 min, but the exact time may vary due to the number of players on-line): running into it with other Scarabs behind your back may send you back to temple. It is also advisable to know the exact spot of Ancient's respawn.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Hints\">Hints</span></h2>\n<p>These hunting areas are good source of food for mages, you can make a nice food loot while hunting scarabs.\n</p></div>","quests":["killing-in-the-name-of-quest"]}